   "versionNonce": 700665,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the ISR: a DYNAMIC quorum\n\nack when everyone CURRENTLY keeping up has it",
   "originalText": "the ISR: a DYNAMIC quorum\n\nack when everyone CURRENTLY keeping up has it",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "o3",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 898,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100096,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700672,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Note the ISR is defined in TIME, not message count. A count-based threshold fails under bursty load: a 10x spike pushes every\nfollower past it through no fault of their own, collapsing the ISR to just the leader and silently destroying the durability\nguarantee at exactly the moment load is highest.",
   "originalText": "Note the ISR is defined in TIME, not message count. A count-based threshold fails under bursty load: a 10x spike pushes every\nfollower past it through no fault of their own, collapsing the ISR to just the leader and silently destroying the durability\nguarantee at exactly the moment load is highest.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
